# <%= module %>

An ordinary Nerves Gate SDK plugin. Open this directory in the developer
workbench under Develop → Plugins, or run `mix dev /path/to/<%= app %>` from the
platform checkout. The workbench can test, package and install it on an owned
simulated device. No solution manifest is required.

From this directory, run `mix test` for host unit tests and
`MIX_ENV=prod mix nerves_gate.package` to package directly. Plugins use the real
firmware SDK backend; no fake hardware backend is included. SDK and platform
libraries are never bundled.

Packages run trusted code in the device BEAM. Native dependencies must be built
for its architecture. Upgrades are cold restarts with a bounded health check.
App data lives on the commissioned SD card; handle unavailable storage explicitly.
